&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;At Superchat, we&#39;re rebuilding how businesses talk to their customers. AI is becoming the engine of that communication. Integrations are what give that engine teeth: the data, the tools, the systems that turn a clever agent into one that actually closes loops.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Founded in 2020, Superchat has become the platform of choice for &lt;strong&gt;10,000+ businesses worldwide&lt;/strong&gt;, from globally recognized brands like Allianz, Auto1, Enpal, Danone, and GASAG to the small businesses, dental practices, and one-person startups that need to look bigger than they are. Today, &lt;strong&gt;millions of messages flow through Superchat every single day&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We started as a unified inbox: one place for every channel a customer might pick, WhatsApp, email, SMS, Instagram. Then ChatGPT happened, and the second chapter began: AI agents that respond across chat, email, and voice at the quality of the best human teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re &lt;strong&gt;100 people&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;profitable&lt;/strong&gt;, and have raised &lt;strong&gt;€18M in funding&lt;/strong&gt; (last round 4.5 years ago, we&#39;ve been growing on our own money since). Headquartered in Berlin.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for a Product Manager to join our Integrations team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you&#39;ll own the surface that decides whether our AI agents are clever demos or systems that actually do work. CRM sync, appointment bookings, call transfers, custom workflows: every action our agents take in the real world runs through your team. Plus our public API, webhooks, and the developer experience that lets partners build on top of us. If you&#39;re excited to design APIs, ship agent tooling, and own a surface that gets more strategic every quarter, this might be a great fit.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re reshaping our product function around three pillars, AI, Integrations, and Core, with a PM in each, operating directly with our founder and CPO Mika. This role is for Integrations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Learn how product is built from the inside, working side by side with our CPO.&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;As our Associate Product Manager, you&#39;ll work directly with our CPO as a force multiplier for the product team. You&#39;ll take on high-impact work across customer research, product data, product marketing and adoption - topics that span the whole product org rather than a single product area.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Who We Want&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hungry learner&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;You&#39;re eager to learn fast, actively seek feedback and turn it into visible progress within weeks, not months.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Structured self-starter&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;You&#39;re highly organized, bring order to messy situations and get things done without step-by-step guidance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Analytical thinker&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;You&#39;re comfortable with data and can pull numbers from spreadsheets or analytics tools and turn them into clear insights.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Customer-curious&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;You enjoy talking to users, ask good follow-up questions and turn interviews into actionable takeaways.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Clear communicator&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;You write crisply, build clean slides and feel comfortable presenting to customers, e.g. in webinars.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scrappy generalist&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;You&#39;re happy to switch between product marketing, data, research and ops, and no task is &quot;beneath you&quot;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI-native&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;You use AI tools daily to work faster and better - from research and data analysis to drafting content and slides - and you&#39;re always experimenting with new ones.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Has taste&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;You have a strong sense for what good looks like in product, design and writing, and you notice when something feels off, even if it&#39;s &quot;technically fine&quot;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Language&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;You&#39;re fluent in English, written and spoken.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Who We Don&#39;t Want&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You only want &quot;pure PM&quot; work like roadmaps and specs and aren&#39;t interested in marketing or customer-facing tasks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You need a lot of structure and clear processes to be productive&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You struggle to communicate clearly in English, in writing or in front of an audience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You get defensive when receiving feedback&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You see this mainly as a title step rather than a chance to learn and get hands-on&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Day to Day&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Strategic Projects (~25%)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work directly with our CPO on the topics that matter most right now&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prepare leadership meetings, drive decisions forward and make sure priorities turn into results&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Product Marketing &amp;amp; Launches (~35%)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Plan and run initiatives that bring our product to customers: webinars, product updates, customer events, newsletters and educational content&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prepare and launch new features end-to-end together with Product, Engineering and Marketing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build sharp slides and reports for customers and leadership&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-lfile-container=&quot;df4b3f91-b87e-448a-89b1-dc2439ff8611&quot; data-pm-slice=&quot;1 3 []&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Customer Research (~20%)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run customer interviews and turn what you hear into clear insights for the product team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Feed those insights into roadmap decisions together with our PMs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Product Analytics &amp;amp; Adoption (~20%)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own dashboards on activation and adoption and turn the numbers into actions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive initiatives that improve activation and adoption of key features&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stakeholders&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product Managers:&lt;/strong&gt; Feed customer insights and data into roadmap decisions and support with research, specs and launch prep&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Engineering &amp;amp; Design:&lt;/strong&gt; Clarify requirements, gather product feedback and coordinate release timing for launches&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Customer Success:&lt;/strong&gt; Identify customers for interviews and work together on onboarding, activation and adoption initiatives&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sales:&lt;/strong&gt; Build enablement material and slides, and align on positioning and messaging for new features&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Marketing:&lt;/strong&gt; Co-own product launches, webinars, release content and campaigns&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Customers:&lt;/strong&gt; Run interviews and webinars, collect feedback and turn it into insights for the team&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Why People Choose Us&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We believe in the power of in-person collaboration: We&#39;re an in-office culture at heart - we genuinely love being together in the Berlin office. That&#39;s where the best ideas happen, decisions move faster, and we learn from and grow with each other every day. We do offer some flexibility for remote work, but our default and our energy is being in the room together.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We&#39;re an international team with diverse cultural backgrounds and languages. Openness, mutual respect, and the exchange of different perspectives shape the way we work together.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We value ambition and drive. We&#39;re looking for people who take ownership, show initiative, and are excited to grow quickly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We work with a high degree of ownership and a strong learning mindset. Asking questions, staying curious, and continuously improving are part of our everyday culture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We care deeply about humility and teamwork. No egos, open feedback, and a willingness to learn from one another matter more to us than titles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits &amp;amp; Culture&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Choose between an Urban Sports Club or John Reed membership, or a public transport pass/Dance subscription.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Regular company-wide and team events.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An annual €500 learning and development budget that you can use for conferences, courses, books, career coaching, and more.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An inclusive and exciting startup culture that supports rapid professional and personal growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A beautiful office in the heart of Berlin (Prenzlauer Allee 242) with free snacks, drinks, and top-notch equipment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We want to build a community, not just a company.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Creating an environment where people genuinely enjoy spending time together is important to us - whether that&#39;s through HYROX training, golf, beer pong tournaments, running clubs, Warhammer, weekend activities, or any other community you&#39;d like to build here.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We believe that diversity makes companies stronger. We welcome applications from everyone, regardless of gender, background, nationality, or religion. Feel free to apply - we&#39;d love to hear from you!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;By submitting your application, you agree to our Privacy Policy.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We look forward to receiving your application! 🙂&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i.imgur.com/Uicf3C7.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; width=&quot;800&quot; style=&quot;max-width: 100%;&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This position is fully remote/home based. Applications will be accepted from candidates based in the UK. This is a 12 month FTC.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Summary&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;PLOS is a nonprofit Open Access publisher with an ambitious mission: to help transform research communication so that science can be shared, understood and used more effectively.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We&#39;re&amp;nbsp;looking for a Senior Product Manager to join our Product team for a 12-month maternity cover contract.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;It&#39;s&amp;nbsp;an interesting time to join us.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Research publishing is changing rapidly. Researchers&#39; expectations are changing. Technology is creating possibilities that&amp;nbsp;didn&#39;t&amp;nbsp;exist a few years ago. And at PLOS&amp;nbsp;we&#39;re&amp;nbsp;rethinking some of the services, systems and assumptions that have shaped scholarly publishing for decades.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;That means there are interesting product&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;problems&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;to solve - not just features to deliver.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;You&#39;ll&amp;nbsp;take responsibility for a product area and work with designers,&amp;nbsp;engineers&amp;nbsp;and colleagues across PLOS to understand the problems that matter, work out where we can make the greatest difference and help the team learn its way towards good solutions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Although this is a fixed-term role, it&amp;nbsp;isn&#39;t&amp;nbsp;a caretaker role.&amp;nbsp;You&#39;ll&amp;nbsp;be joining active product teams working on significant problems and will have plenty of opportunity to shape what we do and how we do it.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;How we work&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We want our product teams to be curious, evidence-led&amp;nbsp;and comfortable with uncertainty.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We&amp;nbsp;don&#39;t&amp;nbsp;expect a Product Manager to arrive with all the answers. We do expect them to ask good questions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;You&#39;ll&amp;nbsp;use continuous discovery alongside delivery: spending time with users, looking at data, understanding the wider service,&amp;nbsp;identifying&amp;nbsp;assumptions&amp;nbsp;and finding practical ways to test them.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;You&#39;ll&amp;nbsp;help the team break large problems into smaller things we can learn from, rather than waiting until everything is known before we release something.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;And&amp;nbsp;you&#39;ll&amp;nbsp;make the team&#39;s thinking visible - explaining what&amp;nbsp;we&#39;re&amp;nbsp;trying to achieve, what&amp;nbsp;we&#39;ve&amp;nbsp;learned, what&amp;nbsp;we&#39;re&amp;nbsp;uncertain about and why&amp;nbsp;we&#39;re&amp;nbsp;making the choices we are.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;As a Senior Product Manager,&amp;nbsp;you&#39;ll:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;1&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Understand the problem.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Build a deep understanding of our users, their&amp;nbsp;needs&amp;nbsp;and behaviours, as well as the organisational,&amp;nbsp;operational&amp;nbsp;and technical context surrounding them.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;1&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;2&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Shape product direction.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Work out where the greatest opportunities lie within your area and help translate PLOS&#39;s&amp;nbsp;objectives&amp;nbsp;into clear product outcomes and priorities.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;1&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;3&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Practise continuous discovery.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Work closely with design, engineering and others to explore problems,&amp;nbsp;identify&amp;nbsp;assumptions&amp;nbsp;and regularly test ideas with users and through data.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;1&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;4&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Turn uncertainty into learning.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Frame hypotheses, design useful&amp;nbsp;experiments&amp;nbsp;and look for the&amp;nbsp;smallest sensible&amp;nbsp;way to learn whether&amp;nbsp;we&#39;re&amp;nbsp;heading in the right direction.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
