&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We&#39;d&amp;nbsp;be especially interested in candidates who have experience of one or more of the following:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
