&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Experience of scholarly publishing is useful but&amp;nbsp;isn&#39;t&amp;nbsp;required.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;What&amp;nbsp;we&#39;re&amp;nbsp;looking for in a Senior Product Manager&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;For us, seniority&amp;nbsp;isn&#39;t&amp;nbsp;about having a larger backlog or knowing more product framework:&amp;nbsp;it&#39;s&amp;nbsp;about judgement.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;You&#39;ll be able to take a complex and uncertain problem, help people understand it, decide what we most need to learn, bring a team together around a sensible course of action and change that course when the evidence tells us to.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;You&#39;ll&amp;nbsp;be comfortable making decisions without perfect information while being clear about the assumptions and risks involved.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;And&amp;nbsp;you&#39;ll&amp;nbsp;help the people around you think more clearly about the product - not simply tell them what to build.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Working at PLOS&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;You&#39;ll&amp;nbsp;join PLOS&#39;s Product team and work collaboratively with colleagues across Digital and the wider organisation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;The role has no direct line-management responsibility.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;The job is fully remote. Some flexibility to work across time zones and occasional national or international travel may be&amp;nbsp;required.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The base salary range we’ve established for these positions is&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;(UK)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;£65,000 - £73,500&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;PLOS also offers a comprehensive benefits package summarized below.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;BENEFITS:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Private medical insurance&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Life assurance&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Income protection &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Personal accident insurance&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Pension with up to 10% employer match&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;25 days holidays, market competitive Maternity and Paternity leave&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Birthday and three winter holidays days off&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;2 days paid time off for volunteering per year&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;Fully remote work environment with stipend on joining for home office&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About PLOS&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Building on a strong legacy of pioneering innovation, PLOS continues to be a catalyst in open science, reimagining models to meet open science principles, removing barriers and promoting inclusion in knowledge creation and sharing, and publishing research outputs that enable everyone to learn from, reuse and build upon scientific knowledge.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our work is supported by a highly skilled global in-house team, partnerships with local scholarly organizations, and the valued contributions of a diverse, international community of scientific researchers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We’re committed to equal opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re working to create a more equitable system of scientific knowledge and understanding. Removing barriers to inclusion and facilitating broad participation of voices is core to our success, inside and out.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Beyond accepting distinct perspectives, we seek and support divergent backgrounds among our staff because we know differences strengthen our teams, our work, and our communities. We strongly encourage applicants of all identities to join us as we work towards a future where science is open to all, for all.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Visit&lt;a href=&quot;http://plos.org/careers&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;plos.org/careers&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;to learn more.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;To learn more about how PLOS protects your privacy, see our &lt;a href=&quot;https://plos.org/employee-privacy-notice/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Employee Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Anthropic&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Anthropic’s mission is to create reliable, interpretable, and steerable AI systems. We want AI to be safe and beneficial for our users and for society as a whole. Our team is a quickly growing group of committed researchers, engineers, policy experts, and business leaders working together to build beneficial AI systems.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Anthropic&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Anthropic&#39;s mission is to create reliable, interpretable, and steerable AI systems. We want AI to be safe and beneficial for our users and for society as a whole. Our team is a quickly growing group of committed researchers, engineers, policy experts, and business leaders working together to build beneficial AI systems.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Data Center Preconstruction &amp;amp; Capacity Delivery Manager at Anthropic, you&#39;ll make sure our EMEA deals are ready to execute before we commit to them, and you&#39;ll take time out of every program before the lease is signed. Delivery dates and costs on AI infrastructure deals are largely fixed at signature. What is missed before then is hard to recover afterwards, and our leverage over the schedule is at its highest while the deal is still open.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;About 75% of your time goes to preconstruction and pre-lease management, from first desktop review through Letter of Intent (LOI) to lease execution. You&#39;ll test whether each opportunity can be delivered, rigorously accelerate its program, and shape the deal so that what a developer commits to can be held to, verified and delivered.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The other 25% goes to delivery. You&#39;ll carry that work through mobilization, embed with the partners building leased and partnered capacity, and lead them to deliver on the fastest possible schedule while maintaining a safe construction site and protecting the finished quality of the data center.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Our EMEA pipeline is getting off the ground, so you&#39;ll set the standard for how deals become ready for execution here. This role offers a unique opportunity to shape how Anthropic secures and activates the compute infrastructure needed to train and deploy frontier AI systems, working at the intersection of real estate, construction, and cutting-edge AI infrastructure.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities - preconstruction and pre-lease management (about 75%):&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Lead. &amp;nbsp;This is a role where leadership trumps management and process. &amp;nbsp;You will be expected to engage developers, contractors, utilities and our transaction teams early enough to shape the outcome of each deal rather than report on it afterwards.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Confirm deal readiness and serve as the gatekeeper to validate transaction viability from LOI through lease execution, ensuring all predevelopment, planning, technical and business requirements are met before commitment&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Give transaction leads an early delivery view from desktop study on capacity, power, permitting, connectivity, schedule and cost, so that the sites moving to LOI are ones that can be delivered&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Run independent, evidence-based delivery due diligence on each opportunity, tested against source documents rather than relayed claims, covering capacity, power, permitting, connectivity, procurement, schedule, cost, and whether the developer&#39;s team, contractors and supply chain can deliver&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Interrogate every developer schedule from the native file rather than summary dates, testing logic, durations, production rates and critical paths, planning backwards from commissioning, and establishing the unconstrained date before any commercial protection is added&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Rigorously accelerate programs during the pre-lease phase by making schedule work a priority for the developer while the deal depends on it, pulling forward design, permitting, power, early works and procurement, and sequencing the build around how capacity turns up&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Assess contractor and supply-chain capacity and long-lead equipment needs for each opportunity, setting a long-lead strategy that secures delivery capacity ahead of need and making the case for early equipment funding where it protects a date&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Challenge Total Development Cost and delivery schedules against the assumptions behind Yield-on-Cost and IRR, flagging where time-to-power or cost exposure puts the investment case at risk&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shape the delivery terms of the LOI, lease and supporting exhibits with transaction and legal teams, including phasing and target dates, landlord scope, diligence cost, ownership and reliance, risk allocation and governance, and check that the developer&#39;s contract with its general contractor carries the same milestones and aligns incentives around accelerated delivery&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Give deal and delivery leadership a clear go/no-go recommendation at each decision point up to signature, with the risks, conditions and mitigations behind it&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Keep one delivery-readiness record and one risk register across all EMEA opportunities, assigning every risk to an accountable owner, tracking it to resolution, and escalating where cost or schedule is threatened&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Direct owner&#39;s representatives and third-party advisers and assure what they produce, bringing design and engineering, cost, schedule, commercial, contracts and procurement into a single view of risk and readiness&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Develop and refine the preconstruction playbook, a reference log of unit costs and benchmarks, and the operating model needed to scale the function, using AI tools including Claude for first-pass assessment, document review and benchmarking so your time goes to judgment and negotiation&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Prepare and present regular executive reporting on readiness and risk for each opportunity and across the portfolio, including time from signature to construction start, risks found before versus after signature, and baseline-to-actual variance, supporting forward capacity planning and strategic decision-making&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities - delivery leadership (about 25%):&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Document the baseline at signature for design, budget, schedule, long-lead position, open risks and conditions, so delivery starts from an assured position whether you carry the project forward yourself or hand it to a delivery colleague&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Partner with landlords and developers post-deal to serve as Anthropic&#39;s primary point of contact, coordinating across internal stakeholders, tracking construction progress, and facilitating critical information exchange between development partners and Anthropic stakeholders&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;You will be expected to be at one or more project sites in adequate amount to shape the culture, approach, and aggressiveness that define those extended site teams. The goal is to impact outcomes in a favorable manner.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;You are expected to be a force multiplier that develops and enhances the skillset that development partners, contractors, and key trades bring to the project(s) you are overseeing. &amp;nbsp;That means being a subject matter expert in the various cross functional elements of data center delivery and increasing the team&#39;s performance with that knowledge and commitment to alignment.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Represent Anthropic in key technical and operational decisions required by partners during the development process, ensuring our infrastructure requirements are met while maintaining strong partnerships&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Drive seamless handoffs to operational state with heavy focus on engagement across networking and deployment teams, enabling rapid workload turn-ups and minimizing time-to-production&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Identify and mitigate risks throughout the delivery lifecycle, proactively addressing blockers that could impact timeline, cost, or technical requirements, and feed what you learn on site back into diligence and the playbook&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You may be a good fit if you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Have 8+ years of experience in preconstruction, development, or cost and commercial management on data center or other large mission-critical programs within EMEA, including time leading delivery on site. &amp;nbsp;You won&#39;t have a big direct team to delegate to but will instead be able to treat the entire cross functional organizations around each deal and jobsite as your team.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Have a track record of testing developer and contractor claims on cost, schedule, power and permitting against source documents, and of telling a deal team when a date does not hold up.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Have taken time out of programs before construction started, and can show how. &amp;nbsp;You read a native schedule fluently and know which levers in design, permitting, power and procurement move a date.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Have shaped delivery terms in development, lease or construction agreements, working with legal teams, and have led tendering and bid analysis. &amp;nbsp;You understand how cost and schedule flow through to the investment case.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Have a strong understanding of the end to end (dirt to delivery) data center development process to include entitlements and permitting, planning and supply chain, execution, commissioning, and handover. You are not an administrator but an active player in the arena comfortable making decisions without the need to consult across multiple external parties.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;You should understand the nuances of data center design and construction across EMEA markets- who the players are, how power and permitting differ, what contractual norms get in the way of speed of delivery, how teams can be incentivized to build and deliver faster than normal.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Have built or scaled a team or function, including directing third-party advisers.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;In this role you will often be on an island and responsible for your own destiny. &amp;nbsp;You will have free rein to develop your own approaches with the mission guidance being your only bounds. &amp;nbsp;No one will be there to empower your efforts, you will create your own influence by building relationships and diving in at all phases to deliver success.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;You must thrive operating with ambiguity and have a willingness to own outcomes, knowing that the buck stops with you.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;It&#39;s a bonus if you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Understand AI/ML infrastructure requirements, including high-density power and advanced cooling systems&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Have had preconstruction or leadership positions (Preconstruction Manager, General Superintendent, Project Manager) within a GC, EPC or developer on hyperscale data center projects or in self performance of hyperscale data center development projects.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Prioritize extreme ownership and have the ability to create winning cultures across diverse teams and job sites.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Are deeply familiar with lease negotiations, construction contracts, or real estate development processes and have strategies to move those arrangements from traditionally transaction and risk managed arrangements to collaborative efforts that align incentives around accelerated delivery of facilities.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Have secured long-lead equipment or manufacturing capacity ahead of a signed deal, including through frame agreements or early funding arrangements.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Have run quantitative schedule risk analysis, or built parametric cost benchmarks across a portfolio of sites.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Speak additional European languages.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;The annual compensation range for this role is listed below.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For sales roles, the range provided is the role’s On Target Earnings (&quot;OTE&quot;) range, meaning that the range includes both the sales commissions/sales bonuses target and annual base salary for the role.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Annual Salary:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;£1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;£1 GBP&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Logistics&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum education: &lt;/strong&gt;Bachelor’s degree or an equivalent combination of education, training, and/or experience&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required field of study:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;A field relevant to the role as demonstrated through coursework, training, or professional experience&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum years of experience: &lt;/strong&gt;Years of experience required will correlate with the internal job level requirements for the position&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location-based hybrid policy:&lt;/strong&gt; Currently, we expect all staff to be in one of our offices at least 25% of the time. However, some roles may require more time in our offices.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Visa sponsorship:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;We do sponsor visas! However, we aren&#39;t able to successfully sponsor visas for every role and every candidate. But if we make you an offer, we will make every reasonable effort to get you a visa, and we retain an immigration lawyer to help with this.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We encourage you to apply even if you do not believe you meet every single qualification.&lt;/strong&gt; Not all strong candidates will meet every single qualification as listed.&amp;nbsp; Research shows that people who identify as being from underrepresented groups are more prone to experiencing imposter syndrome and doubting the strength of their candidacy, so we urge you not to exclude yourself prematurely and to submit an application if you&#39;re interested in this work. We think AI systems like the ones we&#39;re building have enormous social and ethical implications. We think this makes representation even more important, and we strive to include a range of diverse perspectives on our team.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Your safety matters to us.&lt;/strong&gt; To protect yourself from potential scams, remember that Anthropic recruiters only contact you ----- addresses. In some cases, we may partner with vetted recruiting agencies who will identify themselves as working on behalf of Anthropic. Be cautious of emails from other domains. Legitimate Anthropic recruiters will never ask for money, fees, or banking information before your first day. If you&#39;re ever unsure about a communication, don&#39;t click any links—visit&amp;nbsp;&lt;u data-stringify-type=&quot;underline&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link c-link--underline&quot; href=&quot;http://anthropic.com/careers&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;http://anthropic.com/careers&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot; data-remove-tab-index=&quot;true&quot;&gt;anthropic.com/careers&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&amp;nbsp;directly for confirmed position openings.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How we&#39;re different&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe that the highest-impact AI research will be big science. At Anthropic we work as a single cohesive team on just a few large-scale research efforts. And we value impact — advancing our long-term goals of steerable, trustworthy AI — rather than work on smaller and more specific puzzles. We view AI research as an empirical science, which has as much in common with physics and biology as with traditional efforts in computer science. We&#39;re an extremely collaborative group, and we host frequent research discussions to ensure that we are pursuing the highest-impact work at any given time. As such, we greatly value communication skills.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The easiest way to understand our research directions is to read our recent research. This research continues many of the directions our team worked on prior to Anthropic, including: GPT-3, Circuit-Based Interpretability, Multimodal Neurons, Scaling Laws, AI &amp;amp; Compute, Concrete Problems in AI Safety, and Learning from Human Preferences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Come work with us!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Anthropic is a public benefit corporation headquartered in San Francisco. We offer competitive compensation and benefits, optional equity donation matching, generous vacation and parental leave, flexible working hours, and a lovely office space in which to collaborate with colleagues. &lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Guidance on Candidates&#39; AI Usage:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Learn about&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://www.anthropic.com/candidate-ai-guidance&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://www.anthropic.com/candidate-ai-guidance&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;our policy&lt;/a&gt; for using AI in our application process.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 4, 67);&quot;&gt;&lt;img style=&quot;max-width: 100%;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.rightmove.co.uk/careers/content/uploads/2026/09/Untitled-30-July-2026-at-10.03.05-3-8.png&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; width=&quot;1001&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our vision is to give everyone the belief they can make their move. We aim to make moving simpler,&amp;nbsp;by giving everyone the best place to turn to and return to for access to the tools, expertise, trust, and belief to make it happen.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re home to the UK’s largest choice of properties and are the go-to destination for millions&amp;nbsp;of people planning their next move, reading the latest industry news, or just browsing what’s on the market.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Strong&quot;&gt;We are looking for a&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Strong&quot;&gt;Product Manager (Consumer Apps)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Strong&quot;&gt; – 12 Months FTC&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Strong&quot;&gt;Location:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; &lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;p3&quot; data-ccp-parastyle-defn=&quot;{&amp;quot;ObjectId&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;55a68153-7335-547e-9a8c-d95dc03098f4|1&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;ClassId&amp;quot;:1073872969,&amp;quot;Properties&amp;quot;:[201342446,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;,201342447,&amp;quot;5&amp;quot;,201342448,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;,201342449,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;,469777841,&amp;quot;Helvetica&amp;quot;,469777842,&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,469777843,&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,469777844,&amp;quot;Helvetica&amp;quot;,201341986,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;,469769226,&amp;quot;Helvetica,Times New Roman&amp;quot;,268442635,&amp;quot;14&amp;quot;,469775450,&amp;quot;p3&amp;quot;,201340122,&amp;quot;2&amp;quot;,134233614,&amp;quot;true&amp;quot;,469778129,&amp;quot;p3&amp;quot;,335572020,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;,335551500,&amp;quot;2173458&amp;quot;,335559705,&amp;quot;2057&amp;quot;,335559740,&amp;quot;240&amp;quot;,201341983,&amp;quot;0&amp;quot;,335559739,&amp;quot;0&amp;quot;,469778324,&amp;quot;Normal&amp;quot;]}&quot;&gt;London (Hybrid) with 2 days a week in the office&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Strong&quot;&gt;Reporting to:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Strong&quot;&gt;Senior Product Manager&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A note from your future Manager:&lt;/strong&gt; &quot;If you’re a PM who loves getting close to consumer problems, owning a roadmap and turning discovery into experiences that make a real difference, this is a great opportunity. You’ll have real ownership and the chance to shape what we build across the Rightmove apps.&quot;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Strong&quot;&gt;The Role&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;p3&quot;&gt;We are on a mission to give everyone the belief that they can make their move. Home movers across the UK spend more than a billion minutes on Rightmove each month and our website and apps receive over 140 million visits per month. This role joins at an exciting time as we grow the Native Apps&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;p3&quot;&gt;team who &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;p3&quot;&gt;are responsible for&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;p3&quot;&gt; end-to-end experiences on our iOS &amp;amp; Android apps. These platforms are the home of some of our most engaged consumers and will play a crucial role as we develop the leading digital ecosystem for the whole moving experience.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;p3&quot;&gt;Joining the M&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;p3&quot;&gt;ove &amp;amp; Home&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;p3&quot;&gt; team in Rightmove, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;p3&quot;&gt;you’ll&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;p3&quot;&gt; make this mission possible by making it easier for consumers to manage&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;p3&quot;&gt;their move&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;p3&quot;&gt; and home.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;p3&quot;&gt;The Product Development team at Rightmove plays a pivotal role in delivering the overall consumer and customer digital&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;p3&quot;&gt;experience underpinning the Rightmove business. We recognise that to deliver the best products and features for our&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;p3&quot;&gt;customers and consumers we need to work together effectively as a healthy, high performing team. We work&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;p3&quot;&gt;collaboratively across a mix of product and centralised teams, together working towards Rightmove’s strategy.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;p3&quot;&gt;The Product Manager role reports into a Senior Product Manager in our Consumer Domain, responsible for our Move &amp;amp;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;p3&quot;&gt;Home pillars.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;p4&quot;&gt;A typical week as a Product Manager might involve:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;p3&quot;&gt; Lead and shape &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;p3&quot;&gt;the &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;p3&quot;&gt;roadmap, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;p3&quot;&gt;define&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;p3&quot;&gt; and track key KPIs.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;p3&quot;&gt; Proactively contribute to initiatives that aim to improve our customer or consumer experience, both &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;p3&quot;&gt;identifying&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;p3&quot;&gt; your&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;p3&quot;&gt;own contribution and supporting others in theirs&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;p3&quot;&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; &lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;p3&quot;&gt;Initiate&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;p3&quot;&gt; and/or undertake any analysis to highlight any impacts to systems or business processes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;p3&quot;&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;p3&quot;&gt; Take an active role in the experience discovery of initiatives and products, working closely with Product Designers and&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;p3&quot;&gt;Researchers to define the approach&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;p3&quot;&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;p3&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Collaborates&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;p3&quot;&gt;with &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;p3&quot;&gt;Design &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;p3&quot;&gt;to &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;p3&quot;&gt;optimise e&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;p3&quot;&gt;xisting experiences, as well as creating &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;p3&quot;&gt;new ones&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;p3&quot;&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;p3&quot;&gt;Spends time understanding what motivates our customers and ensuring they are up to date with industry insights&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;p3&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Generates unique ideas, is resourceful in &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;p3&quot;&gt;identifying&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;p3&quot;&gt; opportunities, and encourages innovation within the team&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;p3&quot;&gt; Works with &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;p3&quot;&gt;E&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;p3&quot;&gt;ngineers &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;p3&quot;&gt;and Delivery &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;p3&quot;&gt;to understand technology limitations, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;p3&quot;&gt;recommendations&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;p3&quot;&gt; and&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;p3&quot;&gt;development options&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;p3&quot;&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;p3&quot;&gt; Accountable for requirements definition and delivery of solutions across your product/initiatives&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;p3&quot;&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; &lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;p3&quot;&gt;Maintain&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;p3&quot;&gt;s&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;p3&quot;&gt; a backlog of improvements for your area, clearly describing how they support our overall business goals and&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;p3&quot;&gt;work with the Senior Product Manager &amp;amp; Head of Product to prioritise these alongside the wider priorities for the domain&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;p3&quot;&gt;and product function&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;p3&quot;&gt; Work with Senior Product Manager &amp;amp; the Head of Product to help shape the strategic direction, vision and &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;p3&quot;&gt;objectives&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;p3&quot;&gt; for&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;p3&quot;&gt;M&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;p3&quot;&gt;ove &amp;amp; Home&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;p3&quot;&gt; based on clear rational, analysis and insights&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;p4&quot;&gt;We are looking for someone who:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;p3&quot;&gt; Can lead product discovery, culminating in clear recommendations and, where relevant, the best approaches for &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;p3&quot;&gt;D&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;p3&quot;&gt;elivery&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;p3&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;p3&quot;&gt;Has experience delivering successful end-to-end delivery of software products in a technology-led company&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;p3&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;p3&quot;&gt; Takes responsibility for a product and delivers it with an autonomous delivery team&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;p3&quot;&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;p3&quot;&gt; Makes data-informed decisions, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;p3&quot;&gt;leveraging&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;p3&quot;&gt; quantitative and qualitative insights&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;p3&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;p3&quot;&gt; Is passionate about delivering quality experience and software to end users&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;p3&quot;&gt; Has excellent organisational and prioritisation skills with the ability to multitask and make tough calls&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;p3&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;p3&quot;&gt; Effectively manages relationships with key stakeholders, ensuring clear communication, alignment on product goals,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;p3&quot;&gt;and collaboration throughout the product lifecycle&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;p3&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;p3&quot;&gt; Sets and measures clear, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;p3&quot;&gt;realistic,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;p3&quot;&gt; and &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;p3&quot;&gt;timely&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;p3&quot;&gt; goals&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;p3&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;p3&quot;&gt; Builds a deep understanding of how an organisation is run, both commercially and operationally&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;p3&quot;&gt; Actively encourages contributions from all those around them, recognising the value of team members&#39; input when&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;p3&quot;&gt;solving problems&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;p3&quot;&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;p3&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Thinks long-term&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;p3&quot;&gt;and will drive the vision for the product their team is working on&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;p3&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;p3&quot;&gt; Has found the agile philosophy to be second&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;p3&quot;&gt;nature&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;p3&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;p3&quot;&gt; Comfortable describing the technical implementation of their product&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;p3&quot;&gt; Desires to learn and improve themselves and the processes within the team&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;p3&quot;&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;p3&quot;&gt; Is equally comfortable and engaged negotiating the roadmap with product leaders, presenting to senior leaders, or&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;p3&quot;&gt;discussing implementation with our engineers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 4, 67);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Life at Rightmove&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Despite our growth, we’ve remained a friendly, supportive place to work, with employee #1 still working here!&amp;nbsp; We’ve done this by placing the Rightmove Hows at the heart of everything we do. These are the essential values that reflect our culture, and include:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We&amp;nbsp;create&amp;nbsp;value…&lt;/strong&gt;by delivering results and building trust with partners and consumers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We&amp;nbsp;think&amp;nbsp;bigger…&lt;/strong&gt;by acting with curiosity and setting bold aspirations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We&amp;nbsp;care&amp;nbsp;deeply…&lt;/strong&gt;by being real, having fun, and valuing diversity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We&amp;nbsp;move&amp;nbsp;together…&lt;/strong&gt;by being one team - internally collaborative, externally competitive.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We&amp;nbsp;make&amp;nbsp;a difference…&lt;/strong&gt;by focusing on delivering measurable impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;padding-left: 40px;&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.rightmove.co.uk/careers/culture/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;img style=&quot;float: left; max-width: 100%;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.rightmove.co.uk/careers/content/uploads/2026/09/Job-alerts-1.png&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; width=&quot;452&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;padding-left: 40px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;padding-left: 40px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe in careers that open doors and help our team develop by providing an open and inclusive work environment, offering ongoing&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;training opportunities, and supporting charity fundraising events. And with &lt;strong&gt;89% of Rightmovers saying we’re a great place to work&lt;/strong&gt;, we’re clearly doing something right!&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://www.rightmove.co.uk/careers/content/uploads/2026/07/Untitled-30-July-2026-at-10.03.05-1-2.png&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; width=&quot;1000&quot; style=&quot;max-width: 100%;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 4, 67);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;img style=&quot;max-width: 100%;&quot;&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cash plan for dental, optical and physio treatments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Private Medical Insurance, Pension and Life Insurance, Employee Assistance Plan.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;27 days holiday plus two (paid) volunteering days a year to give back, and holiday buy schemes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contributory stakeholder pension.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Life assurance at 4x your basic salary to a spouse, family member or other nominated person in your life.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive compensation package.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Paid leave for maternity, paternity, adoption &amp;amp; fertility.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Travel Loans, Bike to Work scheme, Rental Deposit Loan.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Charitable contributions through Payroll Giving and donation matching.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access deals and discounts on things like travel, electronics, fashion, gym memberships, cinema discounts and more.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We offer hybrid working with a minimum of 2 days in the office. For our roles, such as Field or Home-based positions, different working arrangements apply - full details will be shared during the recruitment process.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
