&lt;h2&gt;In a nutshell&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Picnic, we&#39;re revolutionising the way people buy groceries with our affordable and sustainable grocery service. In the Personalization team, you’ll build the experimentation platform that lets Picnic try new ideas safely and at scale: from which promotions to highlight to which emails to send. Your work lets business teams run experiments and control the customer experience themselves, without needing an engineer for every change. It’s a product that is foundational to our business, and it directly improves how customers shop every day. &lt;br&gt;We use React, React Native and TypeScript across the board, together with&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://blog.picnic.nl/faster-features-happier-customers-introducing-the-platform-that-transformed-our-grocery-app-b38e57a85531&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;our server-driven UI framework&lt;/a&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; and we’re working towards a single platform for mobile and web.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Tricks of the trade&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Think like a product owner.&lt;/strong&gt; You don’t just implement requirements, you question them. Together with product owners and designers, you shape specifications for new features, discuss trade-offs, push back when something doesn’t add up, and help build a long-term vision for where the platform should go.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build bridges.&lt;/strong&gt; You work with cross-functional teams across the whole business: the business teams who rely on the platform, fellow engineers, and the other consumer-facing teams whose features run through it. You make it easy for others to succeed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive things forward.&lt;/strong&gt; You don’t wait for someone to hand you the next task. You spot what could be better, in the codebase, the platform or how the team works, and you take the lead on fixing it. You’ll take on increasingly challenging projects with full ownership of your contributions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Tech:&lt;/strong&gt; React, React Native, TypeScript and RxJS, Redux, Styled Components, Jest, Storybook&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you want ownership, real influence on product direction, and to see your work reach millions of customers, you’ll feel at home here.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;We’re looking for&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7+ years of building and shipping frontend applications end-to-end. You’ve taken products from idea to millions of users, and you’ve stayed around to make them better.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong conceptual thinker. You thrive in ambiguity and lead the way to the right solution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sharp judgement on trade-offs. You know when to build it right and when to ship it now, and you make that call yourself.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Real curiosity about the customer. You care whether your work changes how people shop, not just whether the code is clean.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear, structured communicator. You collaborate effectively with product, design, backend, analytics, and frontend teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Genuine motivation to build consumer and e-commerce experiences used by millions, with willingness to work from&lt;strong class=&quot;text-green1 list-item-text&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Picnic’s Amsterdam office-first environment&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Picnic Perks&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;✍🏼Every expert was once a beginner!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll get plenty of opportunities to challenge yourself and grow, including the Picnic Tech Academy, Lunch &amp;amp; Learn sessions, and tailored soft skills training. We also offer free professional weekly language courses.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;💡Make a difference&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll work in an awesome startup environment with the freedom to drive your own projects and create a visible impact. Our fully electric vehicles and sustainable business model mean you’ll also be contributing to making the world a better place!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🫱🏼‍🫲🏾Teamwork makes the dream work&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With more than 80 nationalities across 3 countries, you’ll be part of a diverse company with plenty of cool stuff to get involved with, from board game evenings to after-work drinks to our company ski trip and more!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🍎You are what you eat&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll get freshly prepared, healthy lunches and snacks (with plenty of vegetarian, vegan, and halal options). Coffee snob? Don’t worry, our amazing Picnic barista has you covered.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🚴🏽Stay healthy&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Mental health is important. As well as having the option to speak with Picnic colleagues who act as confidential advisors, our collaboration with OpenUp gives you easy access to professional psychologists, along with workshops and materials.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;There are plenty of sports communities and events to get involved with, from tennis to yoga, to climbing!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🔋Attractive package&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We offer competitive compensation and a pension plan that looks out for your future self, as well as 25 vacation days per year, so you can recharge your batteries&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🌍Benefits for expats&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;It can be daunting starting a new job AND moving to a new country. That’s why we offer lots of support for our many expat colleagues, if you want to find our relocation benefits, see&lt;a href=&quot;https://jobs.picnic.app/en/relocation&quot;&gt; here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl">Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Senior Adobe Project Manager&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;London, hybrid&lt;br&gt;6 month FTC&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;DEPT® is a Growth Invention company built to help the world’s most ambitious brands grow faster. Operating at the intersection of technology and marketing, our 4,000+ specialists deliver growth invention services across Brand &amp;amp; Media, Experience, Commerce, CRM, and Technology &amp;amp; Data. We’re 50|50 tech and marketing, partner-led, and first to move. Clients include Google, Lufthansa, Meta, eBay, and OpenAI. We have been certified B Corp and Climate Neutral since 2021.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;JOB PURPOSE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Project Manager will work directly with customers to initiate and lead their digital marketing and transformation projects using the Adobe Marketing and Commerce Solutions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Working at multiple levels with the customer, you will evaluate the proposed solution, assess risks, confirm requirements, manage scope, and work on team staffing. You will coordinate and lead all aspects of project delivery from initiation through planning, delivering, monitoring to closing.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Aid customers in improving Adobe solutions by understanding their challenges and crafting innovative, measurable solutions. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU’LL DO&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead teams in scoping activities to identify, gather and analyze requirements, define key business drivers and define an effective and innovative solution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Management of end-to-end project life cycle: effort estimation, scope management, planning, monitoring and execution (including risks management, budget, timeline and others) and related reporting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Management of project resourcing and commercials including forecasting, time management and invoicing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Project communication to client and/or partner and internally&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Accountable for ensuring projects are delivered to quality standards&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Customer focus and results driven - help customer to succeed in their digital transformation journey by providing mentorship, industry leading practices and advice on Adobe Marketing and Commerce Solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Active participation in PMO practice development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU’ll BRING&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong foundational project management skills delivering digital marketing implementation projects for a software vendor (or mixed vendor / customer background)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated project management experience with experience in Digital Marketing &amp;amp; Automation, Campaign or Content Management solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in implementing Adobe solutions: AEM, AEP, and ideally other solutions like Campaign, Commerce&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to handle large single projects or multiple concurrent smaller projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Outstanding at problem-solving, with expertise in risk management, prioritization, and delivering presentations up to the Executive level within an organization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in delivering projects using an agile methodology, e.g. SCRUM&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A professional project management qualification &amp;amp; business consulting background&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Minimum of 6 years project management experience in the industry&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work with virtual internal teams across geographies and time zones &amp;amp; full fluency in English. Other European languages is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WE OFFER:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A flexible, hybrid working policy (2 days from the office, depending on location).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An excellent salary based on experience and equal pay policies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pension, free private healthcare, mental health support, and company sick pay scheme.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;26 days paid holiday (plus UK Bank Holidays).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help getting you to work with a season ticket loan and cycle to work scheme.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enhanced family friendly policies to support new parents.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Social and Cultural Events, plenty of opportunities to connect with colleagues through organised activities and celebrations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Inspirational Talks, bringing the outside in with regular guest speakers and events.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Learning and Development, supporting your growth with continuous opportunities to learn and advance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Buddy Programme: You will be paired with a ‘Buddy’ to help you through your first weeks’ at DEPT®.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A reputation for doing good. DEPT® has been a Certified &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.deptagency.com/en-gb/insight/dept-is-a-certified-b-corporation/&quot;&gt;B Corp® since 2021&lt;/a&gt; and named ‘Agency of the Year’ at both The Lovies and The Webby Awards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Awesome clients. Whether big or small, local or global — at DEPT® you’ll get the opportunity to work with clients of all sizes and across all industries. And we celebrate all of our successes together!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The opportunity for possibility. We want to enable you to do what you do best and help you develop your skills further with training, development and certifications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Global annual &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.deptagency.com/dept-cares-day-2023/&quot;&gt;DEPT® Cares Month&lt;/a&gt; in which employees come together and donate their skills to support local charities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHY DEPT®?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are a Growth Invention company built to help the world’s most ambitious brands grow faster. Operating at the intersection of technology and marketing, we create what is next by pioneering ideas, acting fast, and moving further because standing still just is not in our DNA.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are drawn to people who stay curious, move with intent, and never stop inventing. Our culture runs on three values: better together, relentlessly curious, and get sh*t done. It is how we work, how we grow, and how we make things that matter.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At DEPT®, you will find the freedom to explore, the space to collaborate, and the trust to make a real impact for our clients, for each other, and for the world we are helping to build.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;DIVERSITY, EQUITY &amp;amp; INCLUSION&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At DEPT®, we take pride in creating an inclusive workplace where everyone has an equal opportunity to thrive. We actively seek to recruit, develop, nurture, and retain talented individuals from diverse backgrounds, with varying skills and perspectives.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Not sure you meet all qualifications? Apply, and let us decide! Research shows that women and members of underrepresented groups tend not to apply for jobs when they think they may not meet every requirement, when in fact they do. We believe in giving everyone a fair chance to shine.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We also encourage you to reach out to us and discuss any reasonable adjustments we can make to support you throughout the recruitment process and your time with us.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Want to know more about our dedication to diversity, equity, and inclusion? Check out our efforts &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.deptagency.com/the-good-company/&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Nscale&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nscale is taking on the hyperscalers by building a vertically integrated GenAI cloud platform. We own the data centres, software, and applications that power today&#39;s AI stack using sustainable technology solutions. We thrive on a culture of relentless innovation, ownership, and accountability, where every team member takes pride in their work and drives it with excellence and urgency. As an Nscaler, you&#39;ll build trust through openness and transparency, where everyone is inspired to do their best work. Collaboration is key, and we work together swiftly and respectfully, embracing adaptability and resilience in all we do.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Product Managers at Nscale own the definition, delivery, and ongoing evolution of a part of the Nscale cloud platform. You partner closely with engineering, design, research, and go-to-market teams to translate customer problems and business goals into shippable product outcomes. PMs work across the full breadth of the Nscale cloud, from core infrastructure primitives to managed platform services, developer experience, and internal tools, wherever product leverage is needed.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Product Manager, you operate at team scope. In this role, you will own a major area of the cloud platform and drive end-to-end projects, from problem framing through launch and iteration, delivered within the EU and tailored to the needs of European customers and regulatory requirements. Equally central to the role is a deep grounding in cloud and platform technologies, with a particular focus on things such as security, compliance, and cryptography, which sit at the heart of how Nscale earns the trust of European customers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll be doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the strategy and roadmap for a significant part of the cloud platform within your team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead end-to-end, cross-functional projects across the EU, from problem framing through launch, measurement, and iteration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver product outcomes that meet the needs of European customers, including data residency, sovereignty, and regulatory requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Embed security, compliance, and cryptography into your product area, ensuring platform technologies meet the highest standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive meaningful ambiguity: clarify unclear problem statements, align stakeholders, and define what &quot;done&quot; looks like.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with design and research to shape deep product experiences and validate hypotheses before committing engineering resources.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor junior product managers and raise the quality bar for PRDs, reviews, and product decisions across the team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent your product area in planning, reviews, and leadership updates.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and drive the metrics that matter for your area.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you need&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5–8 years of product management experience in software or technology, with a track record of owning significant product areas.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong technical fluency: you can lead discussions with engineering on architecture, trade-offs, and feasibility.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong familiarity with cloud and platform technologies, with a focus on security, compliance, and cryptography.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to move from an ambiguous problem space to shipped product outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience mentoring or informally leading peers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and verbal communication; you can make complex product decisions legible to a broad audience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to haves&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Degree in computer science, engineering, or a related field, or prior experience as an engineer.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in cloud infrastructure, developer platforms, enterprise software, or AI/ML products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with the EU technology landscape, including data residency, sovereignty, and regulatory requirements (e.g. GDPR, EU AI Act).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience operating in high-growth or early-stage environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Join Nscale as we build a world-class AI cloud platform. If you&#39;re excited about owning a meaningful product area and raising the bar for the team around you, we&#39;d love to hear from you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal Opportunities Statement&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;We strongly encourage applications from people of colour, the LGBTQ+ community, people with disabilities, neurodivergent people, parents, carers, and people from lower socio-economic backgrounds.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;If there’s anything we can do to accommodate your specific situation, please let us know.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;The responsibilities outlined in this job description are not exhaustive and are intended to provide a general overview of the position. The employee may be required to perform additional duties, tasks, and responsibilities as assigned by management, consistent with the skills and qualifications required for the role.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;For information on how Nscale handles candidate personal data, please see our Employee &amp;amp; Candidate Privacy Notice: &lt;a class=&quot;sKJkXMJPyLUkIVvOyxWiZKZqiWNefsPUkik &quot; href=&quot;https://drive.google.com/file/d/1QK5Yg04WHD9K9IAtJgQWubJZC9oLvatK/view?usp=sharing&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-test-app-aware-link=&quot;&quot;&gt;Here.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;For information on how Nscale handles candidate personal data, please see our Employee &amp;amp; Candidate Privacy Notice:&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://drive.google.com/file/d/1QK5Yg04WHD9K9IAtJgQWubJZC9oLvatK/view?usp=sharing&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-saferedirecturl=&quot;https://www.google.com/url?q=https://drive.google.com/file/d/1QK5Yg04WHD9K9IAtJgQWubJZC9oLvatK/view?usp%3Dsharing&amp;amp;source=gmail&amp;amp;ust=1765375172804000&amp;amp;usg=AOvVaw2Ncte4rmlGl8OKuFuDgDtx&quot;&gt;Here.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Nscale does not accept unsolicited candidate submissions from recruitment agencies.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;c-message_kit__blocks c-message_kit__blocks--rich_text&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;c-message__message_blocks c-message__message_blocks--rich_text&quot; data-qa=&quot;message-text&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-block_kit_renderer&quot; data-qa=&quot;block-kit-renderer&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-block_kit_renderer__block_wrapper p-block_kit_renderer__block_wrapper--first&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_block&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;Reddit is a community of communities. It’s built on shared interests, passion, and trust, and is home to the most open and authentic conversations on the internet. Every day, Reddit users submit, vote, and comment on the topics they care most about. With 100,000+ active communities and approximately 130 million daily active unique visitors, Reddit is one of the internet’s largest sources of information. For more information, visit &lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;http://www.redditinc.com/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;http://redditinc.com&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;www.redditinc.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This role is open to candidates based in the UK or the Netherlands.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our ads team is developing Dynamic Product Ads, enabling us to match users to specific advertiser products. Our vision is for Reddit’s product ads to be highly relevant and contextual. A user browsing r/golf sees ads for popular golf clubs. A user reading a thread on r/buyitforlife about sunglasses sees ads for the exact models being discussed, just a few clicks away from a purchase. To achieve this vision, we need a highly scalable catalog infrastructure and intuitive user experience to onboard thousands of advertisers and ingest millions of products into our systems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As the Engineering Manager for the Product Catalogs team at Reddit, you will lead the full stack team responsible for our entire advertiser-facing experience. You will build UIs, APIs, and backend systems that manage advertiser’s products. The team also works closely with the knowledge graph teams to power organic shopping. This role combines technical expertise, leadership abilities, and drive to understand and deliver on customer needs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create a world class catalogs system that can scale to support billions of products&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with product managers and designers to craft compelling user experiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with a wide range of teams from Ad Formats to Ad Delivery to ensure successful end-to-end delivery of product ads&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish and manage to SLAs within your team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be a strong mentor and cross-functional advocate for your team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute meaningfully to team strategy. We give everyone a seat at the table and encourage active participation in planning for the future. Don’t just come along for the ride.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7+ years of experience in backend or full stack product development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2+ years of experience managing engineering teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;re highly technical, enough to solve almost any problem your team has yourself, but you prefer to guide your team into solving them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work independently. You’ll be working with stakeholders that are mostly based in North America. You need to be able to make decisions and solve problems autonomously.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication skills. You must be able to collaborate effectively with teams in a fully-remote environment and discuss complex topics with technical and non-technical audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3156&quot; data-local-id=&quot;8c5ff10a-7296-4539-815b-c31a42a4d2d0&quot;&gt;Global Benefit programs that fit your lifestyle, from workspace to professional development to caregiving support&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3273&quot; data-local-id=&quot;8c5ff10a-7296-4539-815b-c31a42a4d2d0&quot;&gt;Family Planning Support&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3301&quot; data-local-id=&quot;8c5ff10a-7296-4539-815b-c31a42a4d2d0&quot;&gt;Gender-Affirming Care&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3326&quot; data-local-id=&quot;8c5ff10a-7296-4539-815b-c31a42a4d2d0&quot;&gt;Mental Health &amp;amp; Coaching Benefits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3363&quot; data-local-id=&quot;8c5ff10a-7296-4539-815b-c31a42a4d2d0&quot;&gt;Private Pension plan with Employer-matching&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3410&quot; data-local-id=&quot;8c5ff10a-7296-4539-815b-c31a42a4d2d0&quot;&gt;100% employer-sponsored group medical plan&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3458&quot; data-local-id=&quot;8c5ff10a-7296-4539-815b-c31a42a4d2d0&quot;&gt;Income Replacement Programs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3489&quot; data-local-id=&quot;8c5ff10a-7296-4539-815b-c31a42a4d2d0&quot;&gt;Flexible Vacation &amp;amp; Paid Volunteer Time Off&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3536&quot; data-local-id=&quot;8c5ff10a-7296-4539-815b-c31a42a4d2d0&quot;&gt;Generous Paid Parental Leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;In select roles and locations, the interviews will be recorded, transcribed and summarized by artificial intelligence (AI). You will have the opportunity to opt out of recording, transcription and summarization prior to any scheduled interviews.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;During the interview, we will collect the following categories of personal information: Identifiers, Professional and Employment-Related Information, Sensory Information (audio/video recording), and any other categories of personal information you choose to share with us. We will use this information to evaluate your application for employment or an independent contractor role, as applicable.&amp;nbsp; We will not sell your personal information or disclose it to any third party for their marketing purposes.&amp;nbsp; We will delete any recording of your interview promptly after making a hiring decision.&amp;nbsp; For more information about how we will handle your personal information, including our retention of it, please refer to our &lt;a href=&quot;https://redditinc.com/policies/candidate-privacy-policy&quot;&gt;Candidate Privacy Policy for Potential Employees and Contractors&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Reddit is proud to be an equal opportunity employer, and is committed to building a workforce representative of the diverse communities we serve.&amp;nbsp; Reddit is committed to providing reasonable accommodations for qualified individuals with disabilities and disabled veterans in our job application procedures. If, due to a disability, you need an accommodation during the interview process, please let your recruiter know.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl">Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;section class=&quot;styles--3vx-H&quot; data-ui=&quot;job-description&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;styles--2Kv6p&quot; data-ui=&quot;careers-page-content&quot;&gt;
&lt;div lang=&quot;en&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Als Technical Architect ben je eindverantwoordelijk voor de technische architectuur op de korte en lange termijn in projecten en salestrajecten. Je beschrijft en ontwikkelt de technische architectuur inclusief bijkomende integraties. Naast het ontwerpen van migratiescenario’s, onderhoud je contact met de technische en inhoudelijke stakeholders bij de klant en HSO.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join the journey&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Wat ga je doen?&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Jij zet technische best practices op voor klanten en (interne) collega&#39;s. Als Technical Architect ben je de motivator voor de technische collega&#39;s van het klantteam. Als digital leader naar de klant ben je in staat om breder te kijken dan de oplossing die wij leveren en zie je deze in het totale end-to-end klantproces.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Als Technical Architect ben je verantwoordelijk voor het technische deel van de oplossing. Daarnaast:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ben je betrokken in de designfase en bepaal je welke technologieën kunnen worden gebruikt in welke scenario&#39;s;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Draag je bij aan de technische best practices van HSO en draag je deze ook uit naar de klant en het team;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fungeer je fungeer als technische vraagbaak voor de technische en functionele consultants;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Houd je je bezig met integraties met andere (third-party) applicaties, denk je mee over integration patterns;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Zorg je ervoor dat alles in source control terecht komt en dat er automatisch uitgerold wordt d,m,v, Azure DevOps pipelines;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Samen met de Product Owner stel je een roadmap op voor technische verbeteringen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Wat vertellen onze huidige technische architecten over deze rol?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;“Het werk als technische architect is heel erg uitdagend en gevarieerd. Je werkt samen met hele leuke collega’s op projecten. Op het project ben je verantwoordelijk voor de algehele kwaliteit en samenhang van het IT-landschap. Primair binnen de kaders van het project. Echter doordat je implementatie altijd samenhangt met andere systemen ben je ook veel bezig met het landschap buiten het Microsoft project. Je bepaalt samen met de klant waar je naartoe gaat over de jaren heen en ziet jouw plannen dan werkelijkheid worden. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Als je het leuk vindt is er ook altijd ruimte om op de inhoud in te gaan. Als je dat doet ben je vooral bezig met de complexe onderdelen van het project en dat is erg leuk en uitdagend. Naast de projecten houd je je bezig met de best practices van HSO. Je krijgt daardoor altijd de nieuwe ontwikkelingen mee en krijgt de kans om daar wat mee te doen.”&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Wat breng jij mee?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Je hebt minimaal een afgeronde HBO- of WO-opleiding;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Je hebt minimaal 7 jaar ervaring met Power Platform (Dynamics 365 CE, CRM) implementaties in een technische rol;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Aantoonbare werkervaring in programmeertaal C#;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Je hebt uitstekende communicatieve vaardigheden die je inzet bij het aansturen van de techneuten;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Je bent in staat om op basis van de behoeften van de klant een technisch ontwerp te maken en de structuur van de oplossing uit te denken;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Je bent in staat om de best practices die wij en Microsoft hebben opgebouwd hierbij leidend te laten zijn. Op basis hiervan ben je voorstellend en adviserend naar je klanten;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Je bent in staat de implementatie te begeleiden volgens de overeengekomen architectuur en infrastructuur;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Je bent inhoudelijk, analytisch, ondernemend, kwaliteitsbewust en creatief.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Wat bieden we jou?   &amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Werken bij HSO is uitdagend, we willen je daar graag een goede beloning voor teruggeven. Naast goede primaire voordelen bieden wij: &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Een competitief salaris, een jaarlijkse bonus op basis van bedrijfs-, team- en individuele prestaties;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mobiliteitsvergoeding waarbij je of een auto kunt leasen of het bedrag toe kunt voegen aan je salaris. Daar bovenop krijg 100% betaald van de ov-kosten;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;25 Vakantiedagen met de mogelijkheid om er 35 van te maken; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hybride werken, vanuit huis, op kantoor (Rotterdam, Veenendaal) of zelfs tijdens&amp;nbsp;je Workation; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;EUR 65,- netto vitaliteitsbudget – we vinden het belangrijk dat we gezond blijven en een veilige werkplek hebben, zowel op kantoor als remote; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Je kunt deelnemen aan het leasefietsplan; &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;En vooral een leven lang leren. Op dag één start jouw onboardingprogramma, daarnaast krijg je een persoonlijk studiebudget dat je kunt inzetten voor jouw professionele ontwikkeling en ontvang je ook een GoodHabitz account, een online trainingstool voor je persoonlijke ontwikkeling.  &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vrijheid, flexibiliteit en fun&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Je werkt in een internationale omgeving met professionals met verschillende nationaliteiten. Een flexibele werkweek van 40, 36 of 32 uur behoort tot de mogelijkheden omdat wij van mening zijn dat jouw manier van werken bij jouw levensstijl moet passen. HSO heeft professionals in dienst die plezier hebben in hun werk en klaar staan voor elkaar. Om het plezier in ons werk nog groter te maken, organiseren we uiteraard teamuitjes en bedrijfsfeesten, maar ook wekelijkse zomerborrels op ons dakterras, allerlei sportactiviteiten en is er de mogelijkheid bij te dragen aan onze Maatschappelijk Verantwoord Ondernemen-werkzaamheden.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Over HSO  &amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;HSO is de eerste full-service Microsoft Partner in Nederland. Samen met ruim 2500 getalenteerde medewerkers in Europa, Azië en Noord-Amerika verlenen we ondersteuning op lokaal en internationaal niveau aan industriële bedrijven, retailers, financiële en zakelijke dienstverleners en overheidsinstellingen. &amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;HSO is voortdurend op zoek naar nieuw talent. We blijven onze wereldwijde community uitbreiden en scheppen er plezier in om samen te werken met prestatiegerichte mensen met een ondernemersgeest. Professionals die voortdurend willen leren en innoveren. &amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Solliciteren &amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Enthousiast? Heb je vragen vooraf? &amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;Neem contact op met Joseph via (jyoussef&lt;a ----------
&lt;p&gt;#LI-JY1&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
