&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Airbnb was born in 2007 when two hosts welcomed three guests to their San Francisco home, and has since grown to over 5 million hosts who have welcomed over 2 billion guest arrivals in almost every country across the globe. Every day, hosts offer unique stays and experiences that make it possible for guests to connect with communities in a more authentic way.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Community You Will Join:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our EMEA Key Account Management Team is growing and we want you to be part of it!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The EMEA Key Accounts team manages the partnerships with Regional API Software providers and Enterprise Property Managers. The key goal is to grow the share of high quality stays by optimising supply at scale leveraging strategic account management, programs, incentives,&amp;nbsp; and product solutions.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Difference You Will Make:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Key Accounts Manager, you will be managing partner relationships with strategic Enterprises &amp;amp; API Connectivity partners. You will be responsible for recruitment, enablement and optimization of our strategic partnerships and become their trusted advisor with the aim to become their number one partner and accelerate growth and performance on both sides. You will be reporting to the Key Accounts Team Lead, EMEA.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;This role is based in Paris (hybrid, 2-3 days a week in the office), and is not eligible for relocation support.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A typical day:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own a portfolio of Airbnb’s key partners and act as the key representative for these partners.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Execute a global win-win strategy for your portfolio that drives value to all parties and positions Airbnb as a top strategic partner across all distribution channels.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop strong and trusting relationships with executives and decision makers/key influencers within your API &amp;amp; Enterprise customers portfolio, ensure that the partnership is held to the highest industry standards and that commercial agreements as well as SLAs are met.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyze data and utilize data-driven recommendations to identify and action on strategic growth opportunities&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with quarterly goals, measure success against performance KPIs, feature adoption and supply acquisition growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support partners through deep understanding of API and technical integrations&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Educate clients on our product roadmap and all significant product changes to accelerate feature adoption with the aim to excel our mutual guest experience&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent Airbnb in external meetings and industry events&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your expertise:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of professional experience in Strategic Partnership, Key Account Management and/or Connectivity role at a global technology or tech hospitality company&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent verbal/written communication and presentation skills in both English and French&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional stakeholder management across both internal and external audiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with API integrations a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;World class account management experience with strong track record of successfully growing a book of business/geographic area and building enduring and successful client relationships&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in the hospitality technology space, knowledge of OTA specifications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in analyzing, structuring and negotiating complex deals that align across multiple business unit needs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extremely data driven in the decision-making process to ensure timely, impactful and accurate actions are taken.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working cross-functionally with product, tech, legal, marketing, sales operations and enablement teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to manage complex projects and multi-task with excellent organizational skills, in a fast-paced, dynamic and ever changing startup environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong executive presence and the ability to effectively influence top leaders internally and within the industry.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passion for Airbnb, travel, and the sharing economy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Previous experience as product manager, working with product teams is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to travel at least 25% of the time&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Commitment To Inclusion &amp;amp; Belonging:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Airbnb is committed to working with the broadest talent pool possible. We believe diverse ideas foster innovation and engagement, and allow us to attract creatively-led people, and to develop the best products, services and solutions. All qualified individuals are encouraged to apply.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;How We&#39;ll Take Care of You:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;Our job titles may span more than one career level. The actual base pay is dependent upon many factors, such as: training, transferable skills, work experience, business needs and market demands. The base pay range shown below is annualized, is subject to change and may be modified in the future. This role may also be eligible for bonus, equity, benefits, and Employee Travel Credits.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;France Annual Pay Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;€74.000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;€92.000 EUR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reasonable Accommodations:&lt;/strong&gt; We are committed to providing reasonable accommodations throughout the recruitment process for applicants with disabilities. If you need assistance, or an accommodation, please let your recruiter know once you are contacted about a role.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A Note on Recruiting Scams:&lt;/strong&gt; Scammers sometimes pose as Airbnb recruiters to get money or personal information from candidates. A few things that will always be true for Airbnb’s hiring process: our open roles are posted on Airbnb’s Career’s Page at careers.airbnb.com, and our recruiters correspond only from @&lt;a href=&quot;http://airbnb.com&quot;&gt;airbnb.com&lt;/a&gt; or @&lt;a href=&quot;http://ext.airbnb.com&quot;&gt;ext.airbnb.com&lt;/a&gt; email addresses. Our recruiters will never ask for your Social Security number, bank account details, passport, or payment app information while you are interviewing.&amp;nbsp; We’ll also never ask you to pay a fee, send money, deposit or cash a check, or purchase work-related equipment (such as a company laptop) during the interview process. We encourage candidates to remain vigilant of these recruiting scams and not share sensitive information if you do not believe an individual is actually affiliated with Airbnb.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr">Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Digital Content Consultant&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;London, hybrid&lt;br&gt;6 month FTC&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;DEPT® is a Growth Invention company built to help the world’s most ambitious brands grow faster. Operating at the intersection of technology and marketing, our 4,000+ specialists deliver growth invention services across Brand &amp;amp; Media, Experience, Commerce, CRM, and Technology &amp;amp; Data. We’re 50|50 tech and marketing, partner-led, and first to move. Clients include Google, Lufthansa, Meta, eBay, and OpenAI. We have been certified B Corp and Climate Neutral since 2021.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;JOB PURPOSE&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Working with customers pursuing personalisation at scale, an optimal content supply chain is a necessity.&amp;nbsp; With the emergence of generative AI and its potential to supercharge the supply of hyper personalised&amp;nbsp; content we are seeking a Senior Content Supply Consultant to help customers assess, optimise and manage their content supply processes, delivering content seamlessly and efficiently to execute outstanding consumer experiences.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU’LL DO&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead inspiring business discovery workstreams and align with customers on relevant business goals and critical metrics&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Map the content lifecycle from creation to distribution, including all stages and touchpoints.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assess the customer’s content supply process to identify inefficiencies and bottlenecks&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define the role of Generative AI and automation capabilities to reduce cost and time to create, produce and deliver content&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform complex process re-design to align the content supply process to a customer’s strategy&amp;nbsp; and drive dramatic improvements in productivity, cycle time, quality, and customer satisfaction.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define workflows to outline the sequence of tasks, responsibilities, dependencies, and approvals&amp;nbsp; required to move content from one stage to the next.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Guide customers to train AI models on data to ensure a consistent and aligned brand representation across channels&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help customers to assess current brand guidelines and define AI integration objectives, develop&amp;nbsp; AI-specific guidelines, train the team and implement monitoring and evaluation processes.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design effective content approval processes to ensure published content aligns with a customer’s&amp;nbsp; policies and expectations.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop the implementation strategy &amp;amp; roadmap in partnership with Technical Architects and customer teams for Adobe solutions that enable content supply, e.g. Adobe Experience Manager,&amp;nbsp; Workfront, Creative Cloud, Express, Frame.io etc&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Research and define relevant content performance and content process benchmarks&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and implement content performance and content process reporting mechanisms to&amp;nbsp; monitor progress against KPIs&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyse performance and surface insights informing continued optimisation and validating&amp;nbsp; business outcomes.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform organisational analysis to assess barriers to adoption and develop mitigation strategies.&amp;nbsp; Advise and lead customers through the change required to adopt optimised content tools and&amp;nbsp; processes across the customer org and involved 3rd parties&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and enable customers teams on the required capability, functionality and features across&amp;nbsp; Adobe technologies that facilitate content supply requirements with a specialist focus on Adobe&amp;nbsp; Experience Manager and Workfront&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the enablement of customer teams across roles, responsibilities and process that&amp;nbsp; facilitate the customer’s optimised content supply chain.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continually grow your footprint and role within the client engagement and relationship.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU’LL BRING&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ Years of content supply optimisation experience – as a Product Owner, Product Manager or&amp;nbsp; Lead Business Consultant&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to translate business requirements into a technical solution and an understanding of&amp;nbsp; how to leverage content solutions to meet business needs is important.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A deep understanding of Content Management platforms and technologies (AEM, Workfront&amp;nbsp; preferred) from a business perspective and standard methodologies around implementations.&amp;nbsp; AEM + Workfront Certified Business Practitioner.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Complex process re-design expertise coupled with change management experience.&amp;nbsp; ξ Experience with AI and automation with a strong understanding of how AI, machine learning, and&amp;nbsp; generative AI can revolutionise the content supply chain.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with AI model training and the development of processes to secure adherence to&amp;nbsp; brand standards&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding or experience in using productised APIs, SaaS, SOA, Cloud Services, and Content&amp;nbsp; Management Systems is beneficial&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive Agile experience and with product backlog management experience&amp;nbsp; Customer-centric approach&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Outcome mentality and strong ability to plan for and realise business value.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience working with business users and senior stakeholders, software&amp;nbsp; engineers, application architects and digital marketing agencies&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear written and verbal communication skills presenting outcomes, sharing information, and&amp;nbsp; leading meetings&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WE OFFER:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A flexible, hybrid working policy (2 days from the office, depending on location).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An excellent salary based on experience and equal pay policies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pension, free private healthcare, mental health support, and company sick pay scheme.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;26 days paid holiday (plus UK Bank Holidays).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help getting you to work with a season ticket loan and cycle to work scheme.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enhanced family friendly policies to support new parents.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Social and Cultural Events, plenty of opportunities to connect with colleagues through organised activities and celebrations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Inspirational Talks, bringing the outside in with regular guest speakers and events.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Learning and Development, supporting your growth with continuous opportunities to learn and advance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Buddy Programme: You will be paired with a ‘Buddy’ to help you through your first weeks’ at DEPT®.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A reputation for doing good. DEPT® has been a Certified &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.deptagency.com/en-gb/insight/dept-is-a-certified-b-corporation/&quot;&gt;B Corp® since 2021&lt;/a&gt; and named ‘Agency of the Year’ at both The Lovies and The Webby Awards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Awesome clients. Whether big or small, local or global — at DEPT® you’ll get the opportunity to work with clients of all sizes and across all industries. And we celebrate all of our successes together!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The opportunity for possibility. We want to enable you to do what you do best and help you develop your skills further with training, development and certifications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Global annual &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.deptagency.com/dept-cares-day-2023/&quot;&gt;DEPT® Cares Month&lt;/a&gt; in which employees come together and donate their skills to support local charities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHY DEPT®?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are a Growth Invention company built to help the world’s most ambitious brands grow faster. Operating at the intersection of technology and marketing, we create what is next by pioneering ideas, acting fast, and moving further because standing still just is not in our DNA.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are drawn to people who stay curious, move with intent, and never stop inventing. Our culture runs on three values: better together, relentlessly curious, and get sh*t done. It is how we work, how we grow, and how we make things that matter.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At DEPT®, you will find the freedom to explore, the space to collaborate, and the trust to make a real impact for our clients, for each other, and for the world we are helping to build.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;DIVERSITY, EQUITY &amp;amp; INCLUSION&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At DEPT®, we take pride in creating an inclusive workplace where everyone has an equal opportunity to thrive. We actively seek to recruit, develop, nurture, and retain talented individuals from diverse backgrounds, with varying skills and perspectives.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Not sure you meet all qualifications? Apply, and let us decide! Research shows that women and members of underrepresented groups tend not to apply for jobs when they think they may not meet every requirement, when in fact they do. We believe in giving everyone a fair chance to shine.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We also encourage you to reach out to us and discuss any reasonable adjustments we can make to support you throughout the recruitment process and your time with us.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Want to know more about our dedication to diversity, equity, and inclusion? Check out our efforts &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.deptagency.com/the-good-company/&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 18pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for someone who is curious about the domain: what the process is, where people struggle, what is worth solving and how and then solutionise what is worth building using technology.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is an opportunity to redefine the role of design for a world experiencing constant AI disruption. A world where human judgement, empathy, systems thinking, and creativity become the real differentiators, while AI accelerates the entire Software Development Life Cycle (SDLC).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will work closely with CXOs, product owners, engineers and data scientists to co-own the product vision and help them craft the path forward. Within the team, you will drive ambiguity towards real, valuable outcomes through design.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will own and shape the product direction, challenge weak assumptions and stay close to implementation. You will leverage your collective experience as a design practitioner in this entire journey for driving impact on the client side. You will craft ‘new ways of working‘ from a design perspective with the influx of AI.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are not looking for someone whose primary focus is making requirements turned into artefacts, make things look polished or pixel-perfect.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 18pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Expectation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;re comfortable across the full design lifecycle, but you&#39;re exceptional at the parts that make it land: sharp problem framing, design that ships, and AI-accelerated craft.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Consulting with Delivery in mind:&lt;/strong&gt; Challenging the ask and ideating intervention that matters, and seeing them through.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Turn ambiguous client asks into well-framed problems, prioritised opportunities and practical delivery plans.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Challenge assumptions, agreed scope and propose solutions constructively, using evidence and arguments to help clients choose the new scope&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pitch, consult and negotiate design decisions for faster iterations and decisioning.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay with the problem, be the custodian for the north-star&amp;nbsp; throughout delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Constantly reframe design decisions as new constraints and evidence emerge.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Design that ships: &lt;/strong&gt;Owning the work from framed problems to live product.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own design across the lifecycle: discovery, concept, design, build, launch and iteration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create artefacts precise enough to build from, including flows, wireframes, prototypes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design for production reality: complex workflows, edge cases, data and system constraints.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work inside the engineering cadence with technologists, data specialists and product owners, balancing user value, business impact, technical feasibility and delivery pace.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Measure what changed after launch and iterate using product analytics, user conversations and iterate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI-accelerated craft:&lt;/strong&gt; Using AI to design better, and designing better AI native products&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use AI across research, synthesis, ideation and prototyping to compress design cycles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apply judgment to AI output: know when it&#39;s good enough, and when it isn&#39;t.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Spot where AI and automation genuinely move user and business outcomes, and where they don&#39;t.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design AI-enabled experiences that handle model behaviour, uncertainty, failure states beyond screens from user experience perspective.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 18pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll also move comfortably across your wider design practice and bring its collective strength as the work needs them:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in B2B - Enterprise Platforms, SaaS products, Data products or AI-native products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apply service-design and systems thinking across complex processes, teams and technology.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Led discoveries by planning and conducting research, including stakeholder and user interviews, workflow analysis and conceptualising directions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and facilitate workshops that align client and delivery teams and get decisions made.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shape interaction design and information architecture for complex products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with Design systems and alongside AI tooling from the start.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to Sahaj&#39;s product-design capability by crafting new ways of working, building supporting case studies and client-facing thought leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 18pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What will you experience in terms of culture at Sahaj?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A culture of trust, respect and transparency&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Opportunity to collaborate with some of the finest minds in the industry&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work across multiple domains&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 18pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What are the benefits of being at Sahaj?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Unlimited leaves&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Open Salaries&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Life Insurance paid by Sahaj&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Private Health insurance paid by Sahaj&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
